# Security & multi-tenant

- Every till row is scoped by `organizationId` from membership — never trust client-supplied tenant id alone.
- Till endpoints require Serverpod auth (`requireLogin`); reject anonymous writes.
- Secrets only via env / Serverpod Cloud passwords — never commit keys; never `VITE_*` for API keys.
- Validate amounts, phones, rooms, payment methods server-side.
- Honest hardening only — do not claim unhackable.
- See `docs/memory/SECRETS_POLICY.md`.
